# Brand guidelines

> **Single Source of Aesthetic Truth:** Refer to [`/DESIGN.md`](file:///Users/administrator/Documents/Kiki/github/aphogato/DESIGN.md) for full design system specifications, anti-slop liveliness dials, verified contrast matrices, and typography pairing rules.

## Product identity

- **Brand**: Muhammad Hadid Photography — editorial, minimal, high-end.
- **App**: aphogato — internal admin (galleries, clients, calendar, finance, quotations).

## Admin UI (dashboard)

- Dark theme: CSS vars in `globals.css` (`--bg-primary`, `--text-secondary`, etc.).
- Headings & labels: uppercase, wide letter-spacing (`tracking-[0.1em]`, `.label-text`).
- Buttons: `.btn-primary` / `.btn-secondary` or shared `Button` — 2px radius, uppercase 11–12px.
- Spacing: restrained; borders `border-border`; hover via opacity or `bg-bg-primary/40`.

## Client-facing documents (quotation PDF / preview)

- **Light theme only** — white background, `neutral-*` text, thin borders.
- Header: logo + “Muhammad Hadid / Photography” + quote number.
- Tone: plain language (Indonesian OK for WhatsApp templates); avoid corporate legalese.
- Footer: brand stamp (`Indonesia · Available worldwide` + `muhammad-hadid.com`), not payment details.

## Copy & templates

- WhatsApp client template lives in `clientEventTemplate.ts` — keep greeting casual (“Hai kak!”).
- Terms: short, human-readable; DP 50% non-refundable is standard default.
